  "description": "Set your sights farther, get back on a bike and fit more awesome into your day with the motor-assisted Amiti E+. Using Liv’s 3F Design Philosophy, Amiti E+ was designed for a woman’s comfort and style. The bike provides a lower stand over height, making getting on and off the bike simple. Amiti E+ is equipped with a solid braking system for loyal traction and an integrated light on the head tube for safety. The handlebar-mounted control lets you adjust riding modes, and includes key data indicators – battery level and support level. Amiti E+ offers five levels of assistance for speed control: Sport+, Sport, Normal, Eco+, Eco, ranging for 50-350% and the Smart mode, which adds 50%-360% of your power to your pedal stroke. This bike can seamlessly take you from city streets to rough country roads.",
